obj_id: BannerTest4-95783b68
liveboard:
  name: Banner Test 4
  visualizations:
  - id: Viz_1
    viz_guid: 770ae34a-1801-4dbd-bd4e-4762677ff24b
    note_tile:
      html_parsed_string: |-
        Key Drivers:
        • West region leads with $725K sales and highest profit margin (14.9%)
        • Central region shows poor profit efficiency at only 7.9% margin despite $501K in sales
        • East region maintains strong performance with $679K sales and 13.5% margin
        • South region has lowest sales volume at $392K but decent 11.9% margin

        Recommendations:
        • Investigate Central region's low profitability - review pricing and cost structure
        • Replicate West region's successful strategies in underperforming areas
        • Focus growth investments on high-margin West and East regions
